        "image_tilt": -2,
        "shadow_offset": 14,
        "kicker": "",
        "heading": "Love your kid, but sometimes have no idea what to do with them?",
        "body": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Saturday, 7:02 a.m. “<em>Dad, what are we doing today?</em>”</span></p><p>Every dad has been there. You Google it, call a family meeting and open sixteen tabs titled \"Things to do with your kid on a Saturday\". Still nothing.</p><p>Sure, you pushed the stroller. Sure, you survived the diaper disasters and their contents. Then that little creature you made – with some help, let’s not take all the credit – <strong>started staring at you like you have a plan.</strong></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Nobody handed us a manual.</span> So dads wrote one.</p>",
        "button_label": "Get the kit",
        "button_link": "#product-offer-1",
