      "name": "Landing: Offer",
      "settings": {
        "banner_text": "28 answers\nto the question:\n“What are we doing today?”",
        "heading": "A script for every mission. You just show up.",
        "body": "<p>You don’t need to be creative, funny or a Pinterest wizard. Every mission is a briefing: what you need, how it goes, what to say. That’s why the <strong>kit </strong><em><strong>I Am Best Dad In The World</strong></em> exists.</p><p>This isn’t a book that tells you what you’re doing wrong.</p><p>It’s a <strong>playbook.</strong></p><p>It gives you 28 ready-made missions with clear instructions. <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Open the book, pick a mission and go.</span> No Googling, no ChatGPT, no sixteen open tabs.</p>",
        "closing": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">They’ll forget the toys. They’ll remember the nonsense you did together.</span></p>",
        "banner_bg_color": "#ee614c",
        "banner_text_color": "#fef1d5",
