    "landing_excerpts_tgTUtE": {
      "type": "landing-excerpts",
      "blocks": {
        "excerpt_z76cXY": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "On the perfect Instagram dad",
            "text": "<p>And, f%$k you, you Instagram-influencing, perfectly white-toothed, never-seen-a-receding-hairline, abs-of-steel, gourmet-chef-level-cooking, grandma’s-handcrafts-making, flower-arranging-with-meaningful-intent, skydiving-in-your-free-time, startup-founding, stay-at-home superhero dad motherf...! Some of those ideas are great, but good luck not drowning in that nonsense.</p>"
          }
        },
        "excerpt_drVwBD": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Play with a Toy Boat",
            "text": "<p>Spend a good 15 minutes folding it. Dramatically proclaim: “Behold, my mighty vessel!” Place it in the water. Say: “Look, it floats!” Cue the excitement. … Great, now what? The boat just... sits there. You’re bored. The kid’s bored. Everyone is questioning their life choices. Welcome to the most underwhelming adventure of your kid’s life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "excerpt_Xjk7nV": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Reading",
            "text": "<p>Eventually, your kid will develop favorites. And by favorites, I mean the same book. Every. Single. Night. Welcome to the world of Reading the Same Exact Book for the 157th Time in a Row, where you could narrate it in your sleep. Actually, you probably are. Still—super important bonding moment!!!</p>"
          }
        },
        "excerpt_3JgAHr": {
          "type": "excerpt",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pirate Treasure Hunt",
            "text": "<p>The treasure: Three soggy cookies? Sure, why not. The treasure isn’t the point. It’s the fact that it was left by freaking pirates!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "excerpt_z76cXY",
        "excerpt_drVwBD",
        "excerpt_Xjk7nV",
        "excerpt_3JgAHr"
      ],
