    "landing_accordion_66nWAm": {
      "type": "landing-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "item_cbxQGk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "star",
            "title": "What’s inside?",
            "content": "<p>A dad–kid mission system built around a tear-out mission book, with trophy stickers, an achievement poster and bragging rights to earn.</p><p>Inside, you’ll find funny, practical missions with a script for each. Complete them, collect stickers, fill the achievement poster and work your way towards the ultimate title: <strong>Best Dad in the World</strong>.</p><p>No perfect parenting required. Just questionable decisions and stories worth retelling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_qy9BV8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "package",
            "title": "Size & what’s included",
            "content": "<p><strong>Book dimensions</strong></p><p>6.3 × 9 × 0.6 in (16 × 22.8 × 1.5 cm)<br/><br/>Weight: 1.0 lb (460 g)</p><p><strong>Included in the package</strong></p><p>The tear-out mission book<br/><br/>One Dad Achievement Poster<br/><br/>One themed sticker pack<br/><br/>One custom sticker envelope</p><p>Everything needed to start completing missions and earning your first sticker tonight.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_tByHaG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "truck",
            "title": "Shipping & returns",
            "content": "<p>Orders are normally shipped on the next business day and delivered within approximately <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</p><p>We offer a <strong>30-day return period</strong>. To qualify for a return, the book must remain unused, unopened and in its original plastic wrapping. No pages may be removed, no stickers used, and the poster must be unused and unmarked.</p><p>Return shipping costs are covered by the customer.</p><p>To request a return or report a damaged or incorrect order, contact <strong>info@bestdadbook.com</strong> before sending anything back. Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method after the returned item has been received and inspected.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_cbxQGk",
        "item_qy9BV8",
        "item_tByHaG"
      ],
